text Lunch time. We're eating bread in our usual spot.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGNG30"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGNG30.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound GQ9.aac
text @[Furukawa]
text Two weeks from now... I wonder if anyone at all will show.
text Two weeks from now... That's when the drama club information session is going to be held.
text @[Tomoya]
text (Well... the fliers do have the Big Dango Family on them...)
text I hesitate for a moment, unable to answer.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGNG13"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGNG13.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound GQA.aac
text @[Furukawa]
text Okazaki-san...?
text @[Tomoya]
text Eh, I'm sure it'll be fine...
text @[Tomoya]
text All those dango you released around school are sitting on their billboards, hard at work. Have some faith.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGNG23Z"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGNG23Z.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound GQB.aac
text @[Furukawa]
text You're right. There's as many as a hundred of them, after all!
text @[Tomoya]
text (Er, I think that's actually our problem...)
text I make a quiet dig at Furukawa's extreme confidence.
text But seriously, why were those things popular to begin with? Looking back on it, it doesn't make any sense whatsoever.
text Though it makes even less sense to still be a fan of them.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGNG13"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGNG13.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound GQC.aac
text @[Furukawa]
text Speaking of which...
text @[Tomoya]
text What?
setvar strS[1001] = "CGNG10Z"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGNG10Z.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound GQD.aac
text @[Furukawa]
text What kinds of things do you do at an information session?
text @[Tomoya]
text ...
setvar strS[1001] = "CGNG13Z"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGNG13Z.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound GQE.aac
text @[Furukawa]
text Okazaki-san?
text ...I'd forgotten:
text She's not the kind of person who can just rise to the occasion and take care of this kind of thing on her own.
text @[Tomoya]
text Furukawa.
sound GQF.aac
text @[Furukawa]
text Yes?
text @[Tomoya]
text Let's do some practice right now.
music ~
setvar strS[1000] = "BG022"
setvar intA[1000] = 1
