music BGM10.mp3
text @[Tomoya]
text Talk about whatever you want.
text I sit on the ground and give the instructions to Furukawa, who's standing in front of the chalkboard.
text She seemed to have some degree of awareness that she was the club leader, so she'd taken the initiative and decided to stand there.
text If this were just a few days ago, she probably would've asked me to stand there in her place.
text She's really trying to be proactive about doing this.
text It's clear that this means a lot to her; her actions confirm that.
text @[Tomoya]
text (You can do this, Furukawa.)
text I cheer her on inside my head.
text But...
setvar strS[1001] = "CGNG32"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGNG32.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound GQG.aac
text @[Furukawa]
text Um, well...
text Instead of starting her speech, she just waves her hands to and fro, visibly squirming.
text At this rate, the first bell is going to chime before she even gets started.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGNG16Z"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGNG16Z.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound GQH.aac
text @[Furukawa]
text Ah...
sound GQI.aac
text @[Furukawa]
text ...
text @[Tomoya]
text Hey, Furukawa.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGNG13Z"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGNG13Z.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound GQJ.aac
text @[Furukawa]
text Yes?
text @[Tomoya]
text Looking at you now, it makes me wonder... How are you able to act in plays...?
text If she's this bad at talking and this susceptible to pressure...
text Can she really expect prospective club members to take her seriously? I mean, who wants to join a drama club with a president that can't even overcome their nerves? Talk about a blatant discrepancy.
text So essentially these phantom, theoretical applicants... would be faced with not one, but two glaring problems.
text First, the Big Dango Family obsession, obviously.
text And second, a president who can't talk.
text @[Tomoya]
text *Sigh*
text And those aren't exactly small, easy-to-overlook qualms, either.
text @[Tomoya]
text (Not like they would want to overlook them in the first place...)
sound GQK.aac
text @[Furukawa]
text Um... Okazaki-san?
text @[Tomoya]
text Let me be straight-up with you, Furukawa.
sound GQL.aac
text @[Furukawa]
text Okay...
text @[Tomoya]
text You don't have any acting skill.
setvar strS[1001] = "CGNG16Z"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
setimg CGNG16Z.png
if intF[1113] == 1
	if strS[1000] < "C"
		setimg {$strS[1004]}.png -7 -7
	fi
fi
sound GQM.aac
text @[Furukawa]
text Wha...?
text @[Tomoya]
text So you're gonna need to try like crazy.
sound GQN.aac
text @[Furukawa]
text A-All right.
text @[Tomoya]
text Which means you're gonna need to practice for the information session for a while... And I do mean a while.
